                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In compliance with a custom as old as the government itself, I appear before you to address you briefly, and to take, in your presence, the oath prescribed by the Constitution... I do not consider it necessary, at present, for me to discuss...",
